<title>MEXICO: Mexico stocks at unofficial record close.</title>
<headline>Mexico stocks at unofficial record close.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican stocks notched up an unofficial record close on Monday after dealers bought selectively on favorable domestic political and economic news, traders said.</p>
<p>Preliminary closing prices placed the leading IPC share index up 34.02 points, or 0.86 percent, at 4,002.83.</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7907))</p>
